for the Instagram crowd. The stretch between 100 Feet Road and 12th Main has everything: specialty roasters where the barista talks about single-origin beans like a sommelier, hole-in-the-wall places where regulars have had the same corner table for years, and everything in between. Here's what's actually worth your time."}],["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.4rem","fontWeight":600,"marginBottom":"1rem"},"children":"Cafes in Indiranagar Worth Visiting"}],["$","ol",null,{"style":{"paddingLeft":"1.25rem","lineHeight":"1.9"},"children":["$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc"]}],"$Ld","$Le","$Lf"]}],null,"$L10"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],"$L11",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$12",[]],"s":false,"S":true}
